WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Zhang Jianjun

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,720
You're looking for fucking death

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,370
I didn't expect this street kid

4
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,650
To actually appear here

5
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:19,540
We have to find a way to put him to death in Jianguo

6
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,620
Aren't you playing cards at Heitan's house at this time? Why did you think of it today?

7
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,540
Here comes Hong Shulin

8
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,500
If I don't come

9
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,340
How could you know

10
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:27,340
Second uncle and brother Tang

11
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,940
You actually want to steal our stuff?

12
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,820
Even though you can't rob, you still want to hit someone.

13
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:33,700
Zhang Jianjun, you are so awesome. We are all a family.

14
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,020
Don't say it so harshly

15
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:40,610
I'll fuck your family

16
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,370
You're suspicious of bullying me, right?

17
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:52,890
You want to rob my boat, right? Jianguo, stop fighting.

18
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,860
Zhang Jianguo, you are crazy

19
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,820
You even dare to beat your own uncle

20
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:03,340
I don't dare anymore

21
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:15,420
If you dare to attack our family again, your life will be taken away slowly.

22
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:20,320
Zhang Jianjun didn't hurt you just now, did he? I'm fine

23
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:22,160
It's very late now

24
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,520
Let's go home quickly, Dad
